    "body": "## Description\n\nThis pull request adds quote-first NUT-30 onchain melt support across core melt operations, subscription/polling handling, adapter persistence, and user-facing docs.\n\n## Problem\n\nCoco could model BOLT11/BOLT12 melt flows, but onchain melts were missing the quote lifecycle, fee-option selection, execution path, and adapter persistence needed to track onchain settlement state reliably.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds canonical onchain melt quote modeling, preparation, execution, polling, and subscription support in `packages/core`.\n- Extends adapter repositories and schemas to persist onchain melt fee options and finalized outpoints, with migrations for existing rows.\n- Updates adapter contract helpers, core unit coverage, melt docs, and adds `.changeset/onchain-melt-operations.md` for patch releases of the affected packages.\n- Compatibility: this changes persisted melt quote schema/data handling and extends public melt quote/operation behavior for published packages.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' typecheck`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' test:unit`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-adapter-tests' build`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-sqlite' build`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-sqlite-bun' build`\n- `bun run --cwd packages/indexeddb typecheck`\n- `bun run --cwd packages/expo-sqlite typecheck`\n\n## Changeset\n\n- Added `.changeset/onchain-melt-operations.md` for `@cashu/coco-core`, `@cashu/coco-sqlite`, `@cashu/coco-sqlite-bun`, `@cashu/coco-indexeddb`, `@cashu/coco-expo-sqlite`, and `@cashu/coco-adapter-tests`.",
